{"chunk_id":"CH-ADM-A01-DOC-A01-ADMIN-ADMIN_POLICY-0001","chunk_index":1,"chunk_version":"V1-f53b99b4b3f9","chunk_type":"ADMIN_POLICY","chunk_text":"2.5.3 CUTI STUDI\nCuti studi adalah tidak aktifnya Mahasiswa dalam kegiatan perkuliahan dan praktikum dan\nsecara administratif melaporkan dan her-registrasi sesuai dengan ketentuan dan aturan. Syarat dan\nketentuan cuti adalah sebagai berikut:\n\n1. Masa cuti Maksimal 2 semester baik secara berturut-turut maupun berselang.\n\n2. Cuti dapat dilakukan setelah menempuh dua semester.\n\nProsedur pengajuan cuti studi dan mekanisme aktif kembali dapat dilihat pada gambar sebagai\nberikut:\n\nGambar 2.4. Prosedur Cuti Kuliah dan Aktif Kembali","token_count":530,"character_count":530,"document_id":"DOC-A01-ADMIN","clean_document_id":"CLN-A01-ADMIN-001","supporting_clean_document_ids":"NOT_APPLICABLE","source_id":"A01","title":"Buku Panduan Universitas 2025/2026 — Bagian Administrasi","section_title":"Cuti Studi","subsection_title":"2.5.3 CUTI STUDI","heading_path":"Buku Panduan Universitas 2025/2026 — Bagian Administrasi > Cuti Studi > 2.5.3 CUTI STUDI","table_id":"NOT_APPLICABLE","row_id":"NOT_APPLICABLE","event_id":"NOT_APPLICABLE","procedure_id":"NOT_APPLICABLE","page_start":22,"page_end":23,"source_page":22,"anchor":"NOT_APPLICABLE","locator_text":"<!-- locator: source_id=A01; raw_filename=A01__panduan-universitas__2025-2026__verif1__2026-07-24.pdf; locator_type=PDF_PAGE; pdf_page_start=22; pdf_page_end=23; printed_page_start=14; printed_page_end=15; section=2.5.3 -->","raw_record_ids":"REC-0001","official_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Cd8S6GOpP47KIPuON125OaHKdOxZEzHa/view?usp=sharing","publisher_unit":"Universitas AMIKOM Yogyakarta / DAAK","academic_year":"2025/2026","semester":"NOT_APPLICABLE","cohort":"2025","agent_namespace":"administration","mapped_agent_namespaces":"administration","retrieval_namespace":"active_administration","lifecycle_status":"ACTIVE","freshness_status":"LIVE_CHECK_REQUIRED","valid_from":